node chat-ray-hello-hype
kind: reply
pose: proud

    None. Hype is a way of saying a thing is bigger than it is.

    Radiation is what it is. We measure it. We say the number. That's the job.

reply: ok I like that -> chat-ray-hello-deal
reply: what if a thing is actually big? -> chat-ray-hello-big

node chat-ray-hello-big
kind: reply
pose: explain

    Then you say the number and the unit. If it's big, the number is big. No adjectives needed.

reply: fair enough -> chat-ray-hello-deal
reply: ok, noted -> chat-ray-hello-deal

